  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e4dd14f3b6be758",
      "translationZh": "2026年8月12日，阿里巴巴的Qwen团队发布了Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B。这是首次将Qwen-Max级别的模型以开放权重形式提供。该模型拥有2.4万亿总参数（每个token激活950亿参数），采用混合线性加全注意力架构，原生上下文支持高达262K token（可扩展至1M），Qwen3.8旨在应对最严苛的智能体和推理工作负载。这些工作负载包括多步编码、长程规划和自主工具使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "666f6c63e89aba19",
      "translationZh": "开放权重模型为您提供完全的控制权。数据保留在您的基础设施内，推理行为可以自定义，且在大规模使用时无需支付按token计费的API费用。权衡在于运维方面：托管一个2.4T参数的模型需要专门定制的GPU基础设施和优化的推理服务栈。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfad8e49044c2e64",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将展示如何使用ml.p6-b300实例（8× NVIDIA B300 Blackwell Ultra GPU）上的vLLM，在Amazon SageMaker HyperPod上部署Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B。我们涵盖了从集群配置到OpenAI兼容端点的完整路径，包括针对NVFP4量化的vLLM配置、内置推理、工具调用以及原生的多Token预测（MTP）投机采样解码。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4fd253a53db271c",
      "translationZh": "这是我们关于在Amazon SageMaker HyperPod上部署开放万亿参数模型系列文章中的第二篇。关于涵盖Kimi K3的第一篇文章，请参阅《在Amazon SageMaker HyperPod和Amazon EKS上部署Kimi K3》。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9757c88f3a55a59f",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B概览",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5503f9f66ed47274",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B（Qwen3.8-Max的开放权重版本）是Qwen家族中规模最大且能力最强的模型。以下是与部署相关的关键架构细节摘要。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c70340519347cd12",
      "translationZh": "每个token激活的参数量",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65fc44328d8c4612",
      "translationZh": "细粒度混合专家模型 (MoE)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f681da7464cc8b0b",
      "translationZh": "512 个路由专家 + 1 个共享专家（每个 token 激活 10 个路由专家）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4921f71f69dde41c",
      "translationZh": "3 ×（Gated DeltaNet → MoE）→ 1 ×（Gated Attention → MoE），重复",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d060db68d417301",
      "translationZh": "原生支持 262,144 个 token。可扩展至 1,010,000",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a40b163d8603c8aa",
      "translationZh": "原生 MTP 草稿头（无需单独模型即可启用推测解码）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b3d3c787350e508",
      "translationZh": "混合注意力设计是高效长上下文推理的关键。Gated DeltaNet 层（92 层中的 69 层）使用具有有界循环状态的线性注意力，用固定大小的内存取代不断增长的 KV-cache。Gated Attention 层（92 层中的 23 层）使用完整二次注意力，以实现高保真 token 交互。这种 3:1 的比例使计算和内存都保持有界，即使上下文扩展到接近 1M token。对于跨多轮累积工具输出、代码和推理轨迹的智能体工作负载而言，这是一个关键特性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "804353b36ac8e668",
      "translationZh": "细粒度 MoE 将容量分布在 512 个小型专家上，而不是少数大型专家，从而提升路由效率和专业化程度。每次前向传播仅激活约 95B 参数，因此服务成本取决于激活参数，而非完整的 2.4T。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4f012ab37e3aeb8f",
      "translationZh": "能力与推理控制",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00fc6a4d02a4b255",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8 专为智能体执行而设计：多步编码、自主工具使用、长程规划以及复杂研究工作流。它通过 reasoning_effort 参数（low、medium、high）内置推理控制，使开发者可以按请求在计算量与推理深度之间进行权衡。对于困难的多步问题可将其调高，对于高吞吐任务可将其调低。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ac01ffab3efb5698",
      "translationZh": "模型权重与量化",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79430c96ffc5d383",
      "translationZh": "开放权重以标准 Transformers 格式发布在 Hugging Face 上。社区量化版本包括 MXFP4 和 NVFP4（W4A4），可将模型压缩至约 1.2 TB，能够适配单个配备 B300 Blackwell Ultra GPUs 的 8-GPU 节点。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c1e698ee2dcfcc6d",
      "translationZh": "基准测试亮点",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65f42776b5214fd8",
      "translationZh": "根据供应商的基准测试结果，Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95 在研究工作流（PaperBench 93.0）、指令遵循（IFBench 82.8）和基于终端的编码（86.6）方面表现出特别强的能力。它在大多数类别中的表现与领先的前沿模型相当，在更具挑战性的仓库级任务（SWE-bench Pro）和通用工具使用（Toolathlon）方面仍有提升空间。对于正在评估专有 API 自托管替代方案的机构而言，这些结果使 Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95 成为一个可信的前沿级选项，尤其适用于编码代理和研究流水线。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "df4e53b70b00f27a",
      "translationZh": "为何使用 Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 进行大型 MoE 推理",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9acb29d02c6979a",
      "translationZh": "部署 2.4T 参数模型不仅是 GPU 问题。它需要能够处理模型下载、容器调度、健康监控、自动扩缩容和节点故障的编排，且无需人工干预。Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 正是为这类工作负载而构建。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efed7eba29d1ebe9",
      "translationZh": "图 1：Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 的高层架构",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbc624d72785a909",
      "translationZh": "由 EKS 编排的集群。HyperPod 集群使用 Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service（Amazon EKS）作为控制平面。你可以获得完整的 Kubernetes 生态（kubectl、Helm charts、自定义资源定义），而 AWS 管理底层基础设施生命周期：网络、存储、GPU 驱动安装以及 NVIDIA 设备插件。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c206b4259cde62ac",
      "translationZh": "推理 Operator。HyperPod 推理 Operator（自动安装或作为 EKS 附加组件安装）提供单个自定义资源定义（CRD）InferenceEndpointConfig，以声明式方式指定您的模型、容器镜像、GPU 资源请求以及 vLLM 启动参数。该 Operator 负责：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0f9b88f99f258a1b",
      "translationZh": "模型权重下载（来自 Hugging Face Hub、Amazon Simple Storage Service（Amazon S3）或 Amazon FSx）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f0a741fa383eaafe",
      "translationZh": "容器调度和 GPU 分配。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b917de12c480c9d3",
      "translationZh": "健康检查和就绪门控。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b07b8cda0f4f09c1",
      "translationZh": "滚动更新和端点生命周期管理。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd4136d4092718f6",
      "translationZh": "通过 KEDA 基于 Amazon CloudWatch 或 Prometheus 指标进行自动扩缩。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6401d65fdb098593",
      "translationZh": "使用 Flexible Training Plans 预留容量。ml.p6-b300.48xlarge 实例类型需要预留容量。Flexible Training Plans 提供已承诺的 GPU 预留，可直接分配给您的 HyperPod 集群。不会与按需池产生争用，也不存在冷启动容量风险。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31591624aba52d47",
      "translationZh": "弹性。HyperPod 持续监控节点健康状况，并自动替换状态降级的节点。对于全天候运行的持续推理工作负载，这减轻了手动检测和恢复硬件故障的运维开销。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a44ed01729b25d1",
      "translationZh": "额外的推理功能（推理算子 v3.x）：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f3af04f8eb04f777",
      "translationZh": "解耦预填充和解码（DPD）——将预填充和解码分离到不同的 GPU 池，以便在并发负载下实现可预测的每 token 延迟。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "491d8763e2bddb21",
      "translationZh": "推理数据捕获 – 在端点、负载均衡器或 Pod 级别记录输入/输出。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4f3f6b1da9ea0d2c",
      "translationZh": "本地 NVMe 模型部署 – 从节点本地存储加载权重，以降低冷启动延迟。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    }
  ],
